// Package listing holds the phone app's store listings, as text files in the layout fastlane's deliver (appstore/, the App Store) and supply (play/, Google Play) upload, so that the copy is reviewed and translated in the repository rather than typed into App Store Connect and Play Console. It has no code: its tests check the files against the stores' length limits, against the app's name in each language (locales' appName), and against describing downloads from video sites, which the store copy leaves out (yldm-tech/Kando#227). privacy.md has the answers to the stores' privacy questions.
